    <main id="content">
      <section class="mast" id="top"><div class="mast-copy"><div class="edition"><span>Global events operating system</span><span>Edition 001</span></div><div><h1>The world is <i>already</i> happening.</h1><p class="lede">Discover it, publish it, reserve a place, open the doors, and keep the community together after the room empties.</p><div class="links"><a href="https://user.evento-globolo.github.io/">Browse events</a><a href="https://auth.evento-globolo.github.io/">Start organizing</a><a href="https://github.com/evento-globolo/evgl-api">Event API</a></div></div></div><aside class="route" id="route"><h2>A sample night / local time</h2><ol class="stops"><li class="stop"><span class="time">18:00</span><span class="dot"></span><div><h3>Medellín / hardware table</h3><p>Workshop · 26 seats · makerspace · Spanish + English</p></div></li><li class="stop"><span class="time">19:30</span><span class="dot"></span><div><h3>Lima / rooftop screening</h3><p>Film · open air · waitlist moving · accessibility notes attached</p></div></li><li class="stop"><span class="time">21:00</span><span class="dot"></span><div><h3>Austin / protocol salon</h3><p>Talks · community published · venue check-in window confirmed</p></div></li><li class="stop"><span class="time">23:15</span><span class="dot"></span><div><h3>Online / after-room</h3><p>Conversation continues · organizer-owned community channel</p></div></li></ol></aside></section>
      <section class="operations" id="operations"><div class="manifest"><h2>One event. Every moving part.</h2><table><tbody><tr><th>Discover</th><td>Search by place, time, format, language, access needs, and the communities behind the listing.</td></tr><tr><th>Publish</th><td>Give organizers durable event records, venue context, schedules, capacities, and change history.</td></tr><tr><th>Attend</th><td>RSVP, ticket, waitlist, check in, and receive only the updates that affect the actual plan.</td></tr><tr><th>Operate</th><td>Connect organizers, venues, door teams, and live state without turning every event into a spreadsheet.</td></tr><tr><th>Continue</th><td>Keep the people, notes, media, and next gathering attached to a community—not trapped in a ticket email.</td></tr><tr><th>Cross-post</th><td>Keep the canonical event in Evento Globolo, then distribute through supported provider APIs with observable receipts.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><aside class="ticket" aria-label="Illustrative event ticket"><small>Admit one curious person</small><strong>Find<br/>your<br/>room.</strong><span class="code">EVGL / PUBLIC / 2026</span></aside></section>
      <section class="crosspost" id="product"><h2>Create once, coordinate everywhere.</h2><div class="cards"><article><span>01</span><h3>Publish from one source</h3><p>Keep the canonical event in Evento Globolo, then distribute through supported provider APIs.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Respect every platform</h3><p>Capability-aware adapters use native automation where allowed and guided handoffs where it is not.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Watch work happen</h3><p>Live job status, retries, provider receipts, and reconciliation make cross-posting observable.</p></article></div></section>
      <section class="access"><div><p class="edition">Choose your doorway</p><h2>Public discovery. Private event work.</h2></div><div class="access-links"><a href="https://user.evento-globolo.github.io/"><small>Attendees</small><strong>User login</strong></a><a href="https://org.evento-globolo.github.io/"><small>Organizers</small><strong>Organization login</strong></a><a href="https://auth.evento-globolo.github.io/"><small>New account</small><strong>Sign up</strong></a></div></section>
